## 1. Introduction

This register records the Software of Unknown Provenance (SOUP) that
{{ project_name }} ships, as IEC 62304 §8.1.2 requires: what each component is,
which version, who supplies it, and why it is used.

`medharness verify soup` checks this register against the project's dependency
manifests and against the OSV vulnerability database. A component that ships
without an entry here is neither documented nor scanned.

